OL,3,GNEWSA'Bonkers' toll proposed for
OL,4,Asix-mile stretch of M65
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suggestion has been made to introduce
OL,7,Fa toll on a stretch of the M65
OL,8,Fmotorway, in an attempt to trigger a
OL,9,Fdiscussion on how to pay for repairs
OL,10,Fand maintenance.
OL,12,FReform UK county councillor Joel Tetlow
OL,13,Fsaid: "We need to look outside the box
OL,14,Fand do something a little bit different
OL,15,Fthan just what we've always been
OL,16,Fdoing."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
