OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Bonkers' toll proposed for
OL,4,Asix-mile stretch of M65
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnusually, the six-mile section between
OL,7,Fjunction 10 at Burnley and junction 14
OL,8,Fat Colne is the responsibility of
OL,9,FLancashire County Council, while the
OL,10,Frest of the M65 is maintained by
OL,11,FNational Highways.
OL,13,FLeader of the opposition, Independent
OL,14,FAzhar Ali, called the idea "bonkers",
OL,15,Fadding: "I can't believe that Reform is
OL,16,Fsuggesting a toll tax for the people of
OL,17,FBurnley and Pendle."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
